<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I76" topic="codification" id="id4d07529f-5dcd-11f1-b11b-9e551e93f87d"><ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">Codification</ns0:heading>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section was formerly classified to <ns0:ref href="/us/usc/t42/s14043b–2">section 14043b–2 of Title 42</ns0:ref>, The Public Health and Welfare, prior to editorial reclassification and renumbering as this section.</ns0:p>
</ns0:note>
